{"lyrics":"[Verse]\n[00:01.86]Rex made the beat, so you know I gotta murder it\n[00:06.68]They act all tough, but in person, they be murmuring\n[00:11.14]And mumbling, pull a gun out, they get to stumbling, tumbling\n[00:14.28]And the chopper get to thundering\n[00:17.40]Shitting on all these haters, like, where the plunger at?\n[00:20.48]I'm excited, 'cause now I can throw a party and all the people that hated on me won't be invited\n[00:27.58]True Religion on me like the Buddha, Indian style, I'm enlightened\n[00:32.84]I rеmember up in kindergartеn, the teacher told me I wouldn't be shit\n[00:37.58]And then she saw me play the piano and made all the other kids sea sick\n[00:41.16]Even though I got a couple demons, I'm still screaming out, \"Thank Jesus\"\n[00:47.58]Upside down pyramid on me just to compliment the Jesus pieces\n[00:52.50]I was a fan of\n[00:53.36]Yu-Gi-Oh\n[00:53.80], that's why I pull cards on these stupid hoes\n[00:57.74]Got a arrow, not a bullet, Cupid ho, ha, yeah\n[01:02.28]I pop Perc's to numb all the pain 'cause it hurt to live\n[01:07.42]I gotta take everything 'cause sometimes it hurt to give\n[01:12.44]I make money even though sometimes it don't make sense\n[01:17.44]Speaking of taking everything, it's time to take shits on every single person that said I wouldn't do it\n[01:22.98]Every single person that said I was stupid\n[01:25.48]Every single person that said I was that Netflix special, what's the name of the show? Ah, Clueless\n[01:30.46]But no, I ain't clueless, I got this\n[01:32.94]I'm on top so now nobody can top this\n[01:36.12]Now it's time to change the topic\n[01:37.62]I got a way with words, like I'm running with a phonics book\n[01:42.00]In school I didn't do the homework but I still got the subjects\n[01:46.58]Money ain't the object, money is the objective, gotta admit that\n[01:51.34]I'm successful but I feel like my head sometimes a little dreadful\n[01:55.58]I grew up on rock, rap, heavy metal\n[01:58.10]Now I'm ridin' bikes, pedal to the metal\n[02:00.22]I don't even gotta pedal, it's a throttle, so excuse me\n[02:02.76]These niggas faker than some optical illusions\n[02:05.82]I be looking like, \"What the fuck is you doing?\"\n[02:08.86]You ain't getting money, you ain't changing shit, you ain't changing the world, you just stupid\n[02:14.02]Talkin' bout you crackin' cards, selling drugs, killing niggas, and going hard\n[02:18.50]Watch a real nigga come up in your car, now you lookin' all scared\n[02:22.24]Finna piss yourself, shit yourself, you gotta admit yourself, you need some help\n[02:27.06]I gotta admit myself, I'm on these drugs, feel like I can't save myself\n[02:31.86]Sometimes I wanna take myself and break myself, so I can reshape myself, huh\n[02:39.22]Nobody ever felt the pain I felt, so I share it\n[02:43.54]Put it out to the whole world, I ain't embarrassed\n[02:46.08]Bunch of these niggas is my sons\n[02:48.32]I apologize to 'em cause I been a bad parent\n[02:51.38]Don't try me 'cause I'm not the one, see I won't even count to two","words":[[1.86,1.98,"Rex"],[2.1,2.22,"made"],[2.28,2.34,"the"],[2.42,2.6,"beat,"],[2.68,2.76,"so"],[2.86,2.94,"you"],[3.0,3.12,"know"],[3.28,3.28,"I"],[3.34,3.52,"gotta"],[3.62,3.84,"murder"],[3.9,3.98,"it"],[6.68,6.82,"They"],[6.88,7.1,"act"],[7.16,7.3,"all"],[7.4,7.66,"tough,"],[7.72,7.84,"but"],[7.9,7.96,"in"],[8.02,8.34,"person,"],[8.38,8.44,"they"],[8.52,8.58,"be"],[8.68,11.1,"murmuring"],[11.14,11.18,"And"],[11.26,11.56,"mumbling,"],[12.28,12.42,"pull"],[12.46,12.46,"a"],[12.54,12.66,"gun"],[12.74,12.82,"out,"],[12.86,12.94,"they"],[13.02,13.1,"get"],[13.16,13.2,"to"],[13.3,13.66,"stumbling,"],[13.82,14.24,"tumbling"],[14.28,14.34,"And"],[15.46,15.5,"the"],[15.7,15.96,"chopper"],[16.02,16.08,"get"],[16.12,16.18,"to"],[16.3,16.7,"thundering"],[17.4,17.66,"Shitting"],[17.7,17.78,"on"],[17.82,17.88,"all"],[17.92,18.14,"these"],[18.18,18.36,"haters,"],[18.4,18.52,"like,"],[18.56,18.66,"where"],[18.7,18.74,"the"],[18.78,19.14,"plunger